flowchart TD
  A[Select validated synthetic incident] --> B[Show timeline and deterministic risk]
  B --> C[Retrieve policies with TF-IDF threshold]
  C --> D{Policy match?}
  D -- No --> E[AI and Approve/Reject locked]
  D -- Yes --> F[Analyst may request AI report]
  F --> G{Citation validation pass?}
  G -- No --> H[Show error; no usable report]
  G -- Yes --> I[Show report; unlock simulated decision]
  I --> J{Approve or Reject}
  J --> K[Append record to session_state.audit]
  K --> L[Audit History page - session only]
